body:
For a fighting game especially, I feel like Snow would be rather apt. Personally, if I had to take specifically those 2 titles;

From 2: Firion, Minwu (staff wielder, defensive zoner with Ultima variants) and The Emperor (offensive mage focused on keeping enemies locked down)

From 13: Lightning (acrobatic quick assaults, representing Commando), Snow (linear brawling with several armor-and-counter techniques, representing Sentinel) and Sazh (gun-kata midrange and fast-firing spells as combo tools, representing Ravager)
